sections.conclusion_markdown:
Programme complet :

```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main()
{
    int a, b, s;
    s = 0;
    printf("Entrez deux nombres : ");
    scanf("%d", &a);
    scanf("%d", &b);
    s = a + b;
    printf("La somme est %d", s);
    return 0;
}
```

